{"id":"potomu","lemma":"потому","pos":"adv","rank":63,"glosses":["therefore, because of that, consequently"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a8/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это потому, что я люблю тебя.","en":"It's because I love you.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"любить"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Это потому, что он не знает.","en":"That's because he doesn't know.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"Я занимаюсь этим, потому что хочу.","en":"I do that because I want to.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to study, to learn","l":"заниматься"},null,null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"}]},{"text":"Потому что ты идиот.","en":"It's because you're an idiot.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"idiot"}]},{"text":"Том делает это, потому что должен.","en":"Tom does that because he has to.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"must, have to"}]}]}